1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,438
Al Jazeera reports that at least 13 Tunisians are missing after a boat carrying migrants sank while heading toward Italy.

2
00:00:08,388 --> 00:00:13,094
Two people were rescued, according to a migrant rights group.

3
00:00:13,094 --> 00:00:25,829
The case highlights the continuing danger of the central Mediterranean route, where people still risk small boats despite stronger border controls and repeated deadly accidents.

